            "review_title": "Review at Simple Cafe",
            "review_text": "Nana B\n9 contributions\n0\nHighly recommend, обязательно попробуйте!\nDec 2024 • Friends\nЕда была невероятная! Такой вкусной еды я не пробовала очень давно! Настолько вкусно, что даже отзыв надо оставить!\nWhen our friend has chosen this cafe we took it too skeptical, too far from hotel, no reviews, but in the end it turned out best quality food in Nha Trang. Service was way too good for small cozy place in the middle of nowhere. We felt ourselves as in Michelin star famous restaurant. That was perfect experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 2, 2024",
